  "ppNewSection2Item1": "Provide and maintain our services",
  "ppNewSection2Item3": "Detect and prevent fraud",
  "ppNewSection2Item4": "Send you notifications and updates",
  "ppNewSection2Item5": "Improve our app and develop new features",
  "ppNewSection2Item6": "Comply with legal obligations",
  "ppNewSection3Title": "3. Information Sharing",
  "ppNewSection3Desc": "We do not sell your personal information. We may share your data with trusted third parties only when necessary to provide our services, comply with the law, or protect our rights.",
  "ppNewSection4Title": "4. Data Security",
  "ppNewSection4Desc": "We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information, including encryption and secure storage. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.",
