  "ppNewSection5Desc1": "You have the right to:",
  "ppNewSection5Desc2": "Access, update, or delete your personal information",
  "ppNewSection5Desc3": "Opt-out of marketing communications",
  "ppNewSection6Title": "6. Data Retention",
  "ppNewSection6Desc": "We retain your information for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services. After account deletion, we may retain certain information to comply with legal obligations.",
  "ppNewSection6Desc2": "Retained data includes:",
  "ppNewSection6Item1": "Transaction records (for regulatory compliance)",
  "ppNewSection6Item3": "Fraud prevention data",
  "ppNewSection7Title": "7. Children's Privacy",
  "ppNewSection7Desc": "Our services are not intended for users under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect information from children.",
  "ppNewSection7Desc2": "If we discover that a child has provided us with personal information, we will delete it immediately.",
  "ppNewSection8Title": "8. International Transfers",
  "ppNewSection8Desc": "Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your country of residence. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place.",
  "ppNewSection9Title": "9. Third-Party Services",
  "ppNewSection9Desc": "Our app may contain links to third-party services. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.",
  "ppNewSection9Desc2": "Third-party services include:",
