  "ppNewSection10Title": "10. Changes to This Policy",
  "ppNewSection10Desc": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new policy on this page.",
  "ppNewSection12Title": "11. Contact Us",
  "ppNewSection12Desc": "If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us.",
